 <Crumbs items={[{title:'Sources'}]}/><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Go to the original</p><h1>Meet the material behind the guide.</h1><p>The Companion organizes ideas across sources. It does not replace them. Use these collections to find the original context and continue watching.</p></header><section class="split section"><div><p class="eyebrow">Collection 01 · Practitioner education</p><h2><a href="/sources/yusufa-sey/">{siteConfig.collections['yusufa-sey'].name}</a></h2><p class="spaced">Business acquisition education spanning deal sourcing, negotiation, borrowing, investors, and life after closing.</p></div><div><div class="stats-line"><span><strong>117</strong> videos and Shorts</span><span><strong>57</strong> captioned sources</span><span><strong>60</strong> audio recoveries</span></div><p class="spaced">Some short or incomplete recordings add little usable educational evidence. They remain in the source index so coverage is transparent.</p><a class="button secondary spaced" href="/sources/yusufa-sey/">Browse the collection</a></div></section><section class="section narrow"><h2>A growing reference, with clear boundaries.</h2><p class="spaced">The content model supports additional educators, books, podcasts, public resources, and documented cases. This first release draws its practitioner evidence from one collection; it does not claim comprehensive coverage of the acquisition market.</p><a href="/methodology/" class="spaced">Read the methodology →</a></section>
